        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 8511, Heavy Duty Solid Brass Surface Door Bolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nEmtek's decorative door bolts is made of Heavy Duty Solid Brass. It is available in 12 different finishes. The guides are held in place with a unique ball bearing system that eliminates scratches on the barrel of the bolt, prevents rattling of the bolt, holds the bolt in any position, and ensures a smooth sliding action. Each 6 inch surface bolt is supplied with 3 strikes: lip, mortise, and angle strike with matching solid brass phillip's head screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the EMT-8511 6 Inch Surface Bolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Length: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Throw: 1-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Width of Guides: 1-13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Strikes: Includes 3 Strikes</li>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Solid Brass 6 Inch Surface Bolt",
                "description": "Heavy Duty Solid Brass Surface Door Bolt, Emtek 8511 - Decorative door bolts made of Heavy Duty Solid Brass. It is available in 12 different finishes. The guides are held in place with a unique ball bearing system that eliminates scratches on the barrel of the bolt, prevents rattling of the bolt, holds the bolt in any position, and ensures a smooth sliding action. Each 6 inch surface bolt is supplied with 3 strikes: lip, mortise, and angle strike with matching solid brass phillip's head screws.",
